        <mxCell id="generator" value="&lt;b&gt;4  Write answer&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;Grounded Ollama model&lt;br&gt;Full, partial, or decline&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#93c5fd;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Inter;fontSize=14;align=left;spacingLeft=14;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="lane-live">
